SUMMARY:CapMetro: Fare Increase Meeting
LOCATION:Goodwill Career & Technical Academy / Henna Education Center\, Aus
 tin\, TX
URL:https://www.capmetro.org/fare/general-fares-overview/fare-increase
DESCRIPTION:Meeting about CapMetro's proposed fare increases (Jan 2027 and 
 Jan 2029) and reduced-fare program changes.\n\nPart of a series of meeting
 s. Remaining:\n- meeting 6 Aug 2026 (5–7:30pm\, ACC Northridge)\n- meeti
 ng 18 Aug 2026 (5–7:30pm\, ACC Riverside)\n- meeting 19 Aug 2026 (5–7:
 30pm\, ACC South Austin)\n- hearing 16 Sep 2026 (12pm\, Rosa Parks Boardro
 om)\n\nComments open until the Board votes 28 Sep 2026.\n\n—\n\nRSVP: ht
 tps://publicinput.com/Register/XS8587
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:capmetro
END:VEVENT
